        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-xl space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-[#DC2626] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <svg class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
                        <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#050315]">คุณแน่ใจหรือไม่ว่าลูกค้าไม่มารับสินค้า</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-400">รหัสใบจอง @preorderResult.ReservationNumber</p>
